    <h1>About Eduksine</h1>
    <div>
        EdukSine (www.eduksine.com) is the streaming platform for all independent films, standing as a testament to the transformative potential of scientific, technical, and engineering expertise, propelling business expansion and societal growth through innovation. The independent filmmakers and producers who are always victims of the first day and last days in the cinema and who do not have a marketing budget can now recoup their investments in making their films have a platform to show to the world their masterpieces and will give them a voice to share their message about our society, education, women empowerment, violence against women and children and film content about making the Filipinos be critical thinkers and have awareness about the unique Filipino values, culture and traditions. EdukSine has given the people in the far-flung communities where there are no cinemas access to quality independent films at their fingertips and very affordable. We can now reach many Filipinos locally and internationally through EdukSine streaming platform.
